# A text kept from a save race (#427). tests/drive.rs leaves one beside Inbox/Field Season.md, as
# a save that met two other programs' saves of it leaves it: under a hidden name, which the tree
# and Obsidian pass by. The status line says so from the start; the palette's "kept texts"
# lists it with the note it is for, Enter opens it in the reader, d puts it away to the trash,
# and the status line no longer says it. One that appears later is said at once.
size 140x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for 1 kept text
keys :
type kept texts
wait-for what saves couldn't put back
keys enter
wait-for Beside the note each is for
expect Inbox/Field Season.md
expect .Field Season.cold-lava-kept-
screen
keys enter
wait-for The text another program saved meanwhile.
keys ctrl+o
wait-for Beside the note each is for
keys d
wait-for no kept texts
keys esc
wait-for example-workspace
expect-not 1 kept text
write Concepts/.Lava.cold-lava-kept-2-0.md Kept later.\n
wait-for 1 kept text
keys q q
exits 0
